{"v":4,"catch":"躲避雨水，獲得星星，跑過通道！","desc":"《Raindrop Sprinters》是一款復古定屏動作遊戲，你需要一邊躲避雨，一邊跑過通道。\n\n向左和向右移動。按慢動作按鈕。控制很簡單，但遊戲充滿了有趣的秘密！你需要進行冒險才能找到它們。首先，嘗試四次不停地跑向目標！\n\n該遊戲有四種不同的遊戲模式。\n\n- 標準：避免下雨即可\n- 自定義：選擇你自己的物品和障礙\n- 衝刺：享受慢動作的樂趣\n- 特立獨行：繼續趕雨\n\n掌握每種模式的竅門，瞄準 100 萬分！在最高等級達到目標五次即可看到結局！\n\n特徵：\n- 網絡排名\n- 垂直模式\n- 像素完美的選項","publisher":"Mediascape","release":"2023-09-07","genres":["街機","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fd95b0a2c37bd97b3e7d49cb97799feb4a823ebe0ba25875fc3e719d07991755.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/08a17e7603013b66ddc3d65be11f0e56e94a051cfe119ba1a0cac3bdde508249.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b2c60699db296c65d02886739f91bb8c14af6129deecc4b900ed76fbaa893a1e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3973b851b673f3d1ebb1453039d2640d2655be9f9fa982268bca60c02d08bb27.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/edfccf46a3d045768bec84c5709410ddc26747d212417e56d0b28cb92f2753c1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bf8d061b610f80c60770de01f321daaceab350c73ddc5b0cca200b78631ef6f1.jpg"],"titleId":"01004fd01a012000","dlc":[],"vids":["cWpAa7_GqwQ"]}